fpc-mingw-w64: fpc-mingw-w64 (Free Pascal Windows cross compilers)
fpc-mingw-w64:
fpc-mingw-w64: fpc-mingw-w64 provides Free Pascal cross compilers and RTL units
fpc-mingw-w64: for the i386-win32 and x86_64-win64 targets. It builds a native
fpc-mingw-w64: temporary bootstrap compiler from the same source release, so the
fpc-mingw-w64: Slackware fpc package is not required at build time.
fpc-mingw-w64:
fpc-mingw-w64: The installed compilers are ppcross386 and ppcrossx64. When fpc
fpc-mingw-w64: is installed, they can also be selected with -Twin32 and -Twin64.
fpc-mingw-w64:
fpc-mingw-w64: Homepage: https://www.freepascal.org/
